                    {
                        "name":  "places/ChIJ7ecJnDurQjQRvA6z9vANISo/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tKVmNGcENkemRrUmtST2FqVnhiRlpPY1daRmJHYxAB",
                        "relativePublishTimeDescription":  "3 months ago",
                        "rating":  4,
                        "text":  {
                                     "text":  "There are limited seats inside, but the food selection is quite extensive. There\u0027s Wi-Fi and power outlets, and the overall environment is simple and clean. There\u0027s a 2-hour time limit; exceeding this time requires ordering an additional drink. The food portions are surprisingly generous and delicious, and the prices are reasonable. The lemon Americano, however, was a disappointment; the lemon acidity was weak, the sweetness was acceptable, but the coffee was too bitter, resulting in a poor overall balance and a less refreshing experience. I wouldn\u0027t recommend it.\n\nLinepay, credit cards, and cash are accepted. A minimum spend of one drink per person is required.",
                                     "languageCode":  "en-US"
                                 },
                        "originalText":  {
                                             "text":  "內用座位不多，餐點選擇蠻豐富的。有WiFi ,插座，整體環境簡單乾淨。有限時2小時，超時需再加點一杯飲料。餐點意外的份量充足且可口，價格也親民。檸檬美式相對的讓人很錯愕，檸檬酸度不明顯，甜味尚可但咖啡過苦，整體的協調度不是很好，不清爽，不推薦。\n可Linepay ,信用卡，現金。低消一杯飲料/人。",
                                             "languageCode":  "zh-Hant"
                                         },
